WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.170
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.171
and, now, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.172
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.206
Donald Trump's

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.975
former personal attorney
Michael Cohen

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:13.779
was released yesterday from his
18-month-long house arrest.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.615
The decision is being celebrated
by everyone

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.351
from his wife to his kids.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.385
[ As Cohen ]
Do you guys want to hear

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.620
something else Trump did?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.688
"No!"

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.724
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.125
He did some crazy stuff.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.627
"We know, Dad!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:31.497
Get out of the house!"

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:32.665
President Biden traveled

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.734
to Nantucket today
for Thanksgiving,

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.370
but only after Jill made him
swear on the Bible --

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.805
no limericks.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:42.976
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.278
The House Committee
investigating January 6th

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.880
issued subpoenas yesterday
for several allies

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.048
of former President Trump,

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.284
including conspiracy theorist
Alex Jones

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.520
and longtime advisor
Roger Stone,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.121
which could only mean Flap--

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.222
"Flap."

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.391
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.227
Was his name Flattop
or Flaptop?

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.429
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:05.532
I feel like it was
always unclear.

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:09.101
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:10.670
Don't worry, this punch line
will still work.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.905
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:17.110
Which can only mean Flattop
and Little Face are next.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.213
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.248
Why'd you write in
the Flaptop part?

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.917
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.854
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.855
In a new interview,
Dr. Anthony Fauci said

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:32.458
that vaccinated people should
"feel good and safe

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.294
about enjoying Thanksgiving
in their homes,"

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:38.131
while unvaccinated people should
really rely on that wishbone.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:41.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:44.003
"Grandma, I need this more
than you do."

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.372
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.474
Port Authority officials
have projected

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.544
that over 1.4 million people
will travel through New York

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.980
and New Jersey airports
over the Thanksgiving holiday

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.616
and 1.2 million of them
will stand up

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.351
as soon as they call Group 1.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.221
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.357
Germany's health minister held
a press conference yesterday

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.826
to address the country's spike
in coronavirus cases

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.995
and said that Germans
will either be,

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:12.899
"vaccinated, recovered,
or dead by the end of winter."

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.601
Or, as it's called in Germany,
a pep talk.

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:18.704
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:20.939
Analysts are projecting that,
this year,

00:02:20.939 --> 00:02:23.209
there will be a smaller
selection of Christmas trees

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.711
for Americans to choose from,

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:27.046
which explains the one
outside of 30 Rock.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:30.150
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.285 --> 00:02:35.221
Did you think it was going
to be that little, Baze?

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:38.424
I thought it was supposed
to be four feet,

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.692
but I guess I don't know
the difference

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.094
between feet and inches.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.396
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:44.397
That's a real little fella.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:46.365
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:48.000
And, finally, an Oklahoma woman

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.302
was recently kicked
out of church

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.471
after she brought cilantro
to a service

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.273
that was mistaken for marijuana,

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:55.107
which was a double whammy
because, "A,"

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.975
she got kicked out of her church
and, "B,"

00:02:56.975 --> 00:02:58.978
she got ripped off
by her weed guy.

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:02.048
[ Laughter and applause ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

